TEXT 240 448 Left 1 ;I_CONST,Gm (start-up / constant-gm)
TEXT 1232 432 Left 1 ;I_CONST (= IREF)
TEXT 1600 800 Left 1 ;IPTAT (R3)
TEXT 1664 640 Left 1 ;ICTAT (R4)
TEXT 1216 640 Left 1 ;ICTAT (R2)
TEXT 2640 416 Left 1 ;2 I_CONST
TEXT 3104 288 Left 1 ;VREF = VDD of DAC + OpAmp
TEXT 1560 3040 Left 2 ;16 NMOS transistors in series (M58a-p), each W/L = 30u/3u
TEXT 1856 1900 Left 2 ;W-2W current mirrors
TEXT 3536 3040 Left 2 ;IOUT -> RDAC and op-amp (+)
TEXT 5376 2512 Left 2 ;Ground-compatible folded-cascode op-amp: PMOS input pair M32 (+) / M33 (-), NMOS folding M34/M41 + cascodes M35/M40, PMOS cascode mirror load M36-M39, second stage M42 with M43/M44 load, cascode (Ahuja) compensation CA to node F2, source-follower output M45 (L = 0.6u) with ROUT pull-down.
TEXT 3424 200 Left 2 ;VREF = VDD (VREG used as VDD)
TEXT 0 3700 Left 2 ;Complete 6-bit segmented current-steering DAC (6-bit DAC.pdf pages 1-4): voltage regulator (top), DAC core (bottom left), folded-cascode op-amp (right). One Vunregulated source, one ground.
TEXT 0 3748 Left 2 !.include EE4323_cmos.mos
TEXT 0 3788 Left 2 !.include EE4323_bjt.lib
TEXT 0 3828 Left 2 !.tran 0 0.00148 0 1e-07
